lassName\\\":\\\"text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"We use cookies, local storage, and similar technologies to run core features (authentication, session continuity), remember preferences, and analyze usage/performance. Where required, we'll request consent and provide choices (e.g., cookie banner). You can manage cookies via your browser; blocking some cookies may impact functionality.\\\"}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"9:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pt-4 border-t border-border\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-extrabold text-foreground mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"6) How We Share Information\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"We share information with:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"ul\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-3 text-foreground/80 mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Service providers/subprocessors\\\"}],\\\" (cloud hosting, security, analytics, email, customer support) under contracts requiring confidentiality and appropriate safeguards.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Integrations you enable\\\"}],\\\" (help desks, analytics, knowledge sources) as instructed by you.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Professional advisors\\\"}],\\\" and \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"law enforcement\\\"}],\\\" when required by law or to protect rights, safety, and security.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong